# Cursor Rules for OpenFrost

Read and strictly adhere to `AGENTS.md`, `docs/ai-os-project-spec.md`, and
`backlog/solo-rebuild.md`.

## Current state

S00–S06, S08 Phase 1, and S09 (Rust Ratatui + Crossterm TUI Control Center in
`apps/tui`, replacing the removed `apps/web`) are implemented on `main`.
`apps/landing` is a static Next.js product page. S07's one-working-week
owner-use evaluation gate remains open.

## Rules

1. Implement only the explicitly assigned item in `backlog/solo-rebuild.md`.
2. Use strict TypeScript (no `any`) and shared Zod contracts in `packages/domain`.
   Keep Rust serde types in `apps/tui/src/contracts.rs` aligned with `packages/domain`.
3. Use local `better-sqlite3` + Drizzle with additive migrations (`packages/db`)
   and Markdown as canonical storage for approved memory. No Docker or cloud DB.
4. Protect credentials with Windows DPAPI (`packages/db/src/dpapi.ts`); never
   commit, log, or echo plaintext keys.
5. Enforce the `auto`, `telegram`, and `local` risk tiers and security
   boundaries per `AGENTS.md`.
6. Verify changes before handoff:
   - TypeScript workspace: `pnpm lint && pnpm test && pnpm build`
   - Rust TUI (`apps/tui`): `cargo fmt --all -- --check && cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings && cargo test && cargo build`
